00:30:24.690 --> 00:30:27.317
collapsed and all we need to do is to
break it in now.

00:30:27.320 --> 00:30:30.920
To break in the Mini Magic Ball, I first like to collapse it, pressing

00:30:30.920 --> 00:30:35.129
and squishing it back and forth just
like this. Then I like to push on top

00:30:35.129 --> 00:30:40.080
until it turns inside out you'll notice
when you do that it flattens and forms a

00:30:40.080 --> 00:30:44.279
lip or ridge on the top. Then you can
transform it into an eight-pointed star

00:30:44.279 --> 00:30:49.619
just like this with a smaller eight
pointed star inside you need to crease

00:30:49.619 --> 00:30:52.830
these outside points by pinching them
one at a time.

00:30:52.830 --> 00:30:56.999
Once you have the flower shape you can
then stretch it by pulling on outside

00:30:56.999 --> 00:31:02.070
points. To open or inflate the ball again
you need to pull up and out on the

00:31:02.070 --> 00:31:07.559
outside of the opposite inside points to
reinflate the ball. At this point we

00:31:07.559 --> 00:31:12.389
need to fix any folds which may have
been collapsed, unfolded or crushed and

00:31:12.389 --> 00:31:16.499
then we could squish or collapse back
together like we did when we first

00:31:16.499 --> 00:31:21.089
connected it at the ends. Once it's
broken in then you could try turning it

00:31:21.089 --> 00:31:25.380
inside out just like this but be careful
not to rip it. And there you go you have

00:31:25.380 --> 00:31:27.460
finished your Mini Magic Ball!

